<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 39 0 R/T(In today's digital landscape, businesses are inundated with vast amounts of customer feedback from various channels\204social media, reviews, emails, and more. Deciphering this unstructured data to extract meaningful insights can be daunting. This is where sentiment analysis, powered by artificial intelligence \(AI\), becomes invaluable.)/E(In today's digital landscape, businesses are inundated with vast amounts of customer feedback from various channels\204social media, reviews, emails, and more. Deciphering this unstructured data to extract meaningful insights can be daunting. This is where sentiment analysis, powered by artificial intelligence \(AI\), becomes invaluable.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[3]>>
