115 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 39 0 R/T(This eBook delves into the transformative power of AI-driven sentiment analysis, guiding you through its fundamentals, implementation strategies, and the myriad benefits it offers. Whether you're a marketing manager aiming to craft personalized campaigns, a product developer seeking to align offerings with customer expectations, or a customer service leader striving to enhance engagement, this guide provides the knowledge and tools to harness sentiment analysis effectively.)/E(This eBook delves into the transformative power of AI-driven sentiment analysis, guiding you through its fundamentals, implementation strategies, and the myriad benefits it offers. Whether you're a marketing manager aiming to craft personalized campaigns, a product developer seeking to align offerings with customer expectations, or a customer service leader striving to enhance engagement, this guide provides the knowledge and tools to harness sentiment analysis effectively.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[4]>>
