endobj

569 0 obj
<</Title(Accuracy: Measure the proportion of correctly predicted sentiments.)/Dest[12 0 R/Fit]/Parent 483 0 R/Prev 586 0 R/Next 528 0 R>>
endobj

570 0 obj
<</Title(In today's digital landscape, businesses are inundated with vast amounts of customer feedback from various channels\204social media, reviews, emails, and more. Deciphering this unstructured data to extract meaningful insights can be daunting. This is where sentiment analysis, powered by artificial intelligence \(AI\), becomes invaluable.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 529 0 R/Next 571 0 R>>
endobj

571 0 obj
<</Title(This eBook delves into the transformative power of AI-driven sentiment analysis, guiding you through its fundamentals, implementation strategies, and the myriad benefits it offers. Whether you're a marketing manager aiming to craft personalized campaigns, a product developer seeking to align offerings with customer expectations, or a customer service leader striving to enhance engagement, this guide provides the knowledge and tools to harness sentiment analysis effectively.)/Dest[13 0 R/Fit]/Parent 529 0 R/Prev 570 0 R>>
endobj

572 0 obj
<</Title(CHAPTER I)/Dest[14 0 R/Fit]/Parent 7 0 R/Prev 529 0 R/Next 587 0 R>>
endobj

